sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Cycle as OODA Act phase
  participant Spawn as dispatch_spawn_engineer
  participant Repo as repo_resolver
  participant Admission as admission gates
  participant Worktree as EngineerWorktree
  participant Supervisor as agent_supervisor
  participant Child as simard engineer run single-process
  participant AgentLoop as engineer_loop::spawn_agent_for_goal
  participant Amplihack as amplihack copilot/RustyClawd
  participant GitHub as git/gh remote

  Cycle->>Spawn: PlannedAction spawn_engineer(goal, task)
  Spawn->>Spawn: read-only posture rails and duplicate-live checks
  Spawn->>Repo: resolve_goal_repo(goal.repo)
  Repo-->>Spawn: target parent repo or loud failure
  Spawn->>Admission: overlap admission + resource admission
  Admission-->>Spawn: Admit/Defer/ReclaimFirst
  Spawn->>Worktree: allocate(parent_repo, state_root, goal_id)
  Worktree-->>Spawn: isolated worktree path + branch
  Spawn->>Spawn: ensure_amplihack_fresh()
  Spawn->>Supervisor: spawn_subordinate(SubordinateConfig)
  Supervisor->>Child: tmux or direct process: simard engineer run single-process <worktree> <goal>
  Child->>AgentLoop: spawn_agent_for_goal(objective, inspection, workspace)
  AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: build_agent_prompt + quality standards
  AgentLoop->>Amplihack: run_engineer_subprocess(prompt on stdin for copilot)
  Amplihack->>GitHub: implement, test, commit, gh pr create per prompt/tools
  GitHub-->>Amplihack: PR URL/status
  Amplihack-->>AgentLoop: trailing summary
  AgentLoop-->>Child: execution summary
  Child-->>Supervisor: subprocess exits naturally
  Supervisor-->>Spawn: pid/session handle recorded
